cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it together with the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "OCUDU-ZMQ-Radio-Fault: C and Python ZMQ channel brokers with finite, verifiable radio faults"
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/BabakAz/OCUDU-ZMQ-Radio-Fault"
authors:
  - alias: BabakAz
  - alias: MaximBitiu1
abstract: >-
  Two interchangeable channel brokers for the ZeroMQ virtual radio of OCUDU
  and srsRAN-family 5G NR gNBs and srsUE, with finite, directional,
  sample-scheduled faults (blanking, attenuation, AWGN, CW, carrier-frequency
  offset and static 3GPP TR 38.901 TDL-A/TDL-C), authenticated arming,
  explicit restoration and verifiable truth records. Released from the study
  "Controlled Radio Fault Injection and Cross-Layer Observability for Open 5G
  RANs".
keywords:
  - 5G NR
  - Open RAN
  - fault injection
  - channel emulation
  - ZeroMQ
  - OCUDU
  - srsRAN
